WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.780
A ship, locked in pack ice.

2
00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.720
In a cabin, a lamp, a desk, and a letter
to Walton's sister, Margaret Saville.

3
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:12.570
Inside the letter, a second
story, in different ink.

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.090
Inside that, a third voice.

5
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.430
Far off on the ice, a sledge races past.

6
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.750
The crew glimpse "a being
which had the shape of a man,

7
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.630
but apparently of gigantic stature".

8
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.220
Three narrators, one monster.

9
00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.440
So whose story can we trust?

10
00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:33.870
In this mission, you'll open the
frames: Walton writing to his sister,

11
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.790
Victor speaking to Walton, the
Creature speaking to Victor.

12
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.320
And you'll see how Shelley
rebuilds the Gothic around science,

13
00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.920
rather than ghosts.

14
00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:46.370
Your mission: decide
whose story we can trust.
